<title>UK: Copper, aluminium ease on LME, end off highs.</title>
<headline>Copper, aluminium ease on LME, end off highs.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Sent packing at $2,600, ends with pared gains, however, as spreads remain tight.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM  - Closes off highs, as $1,600 level overhead defended.</p>
<p>LEAD/ZINC - Both close steadier, around highs of narrow ranges.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Ends steadier, trades modestly above $7,200.</p>
<p>TIN - Finishes slightly steadier, market quiet.</p>
<p>ALLOY - Dull.</p>
</text>
